              "fact": "crisis-resolved"
            },
            {
              "kind": "addCareerFact",
              "career": "tavern",
              "fact": "crisis-broker"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "protect-shelter",
          "label": "Protect temporary shelter and confidentiality",
          "text": "You start with the safety of people who have nowhere practical to go tonight, then adjust the house rules so temporary protection does not become a promise of unlimited free housing. The house helps while keeping boundaries, rules, and the ability to function tomorrow.",
